# Every text file is checked out with LF, on Windows too: Git for Windows defaults to
# core.autocrlf=true, and the tests run under WSL/Linux, where CRLF sources and scripts
# misbehave. Binary files are left alone (text=auto detects them).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Byte-exact golden files: never let git rewrite line endings (core.autocrlf on Windows would
# otherwise turn LF into CRLF and break the byte-for-byte comparisons).
tests/fixtures/golden_icl/* -text
tests/fixtures/golden_bsdl/* -text
